PYEPIX

Though ePiX can be compiled and run using CygWin, Windows users may be
more interested in Andrew Sterian's Pyepix package, an implementation
of ePiX-0.8.9 in Python. Pyepix is available from

  http://claymore.engineer.gvsu.edu/~steriana/Python/index.html

and requires Python 2.2 or newer.


MAILING LIST

There is a mailing list devoted to all things ePiX-related. To
subscribe, send an empty message to

  ahwang-epix-subscribe@mathcs.holycross.edu

You must complete a three-way handshake: The list software will send
you a reply, to which you must reply.  To post to the list, send an
email with *non-empty Subject: line* to

  ahwang-epix@mathcs.holycross.edu

To unsubscribe, send a message to

  ahwang-epix-unsubscribe@mathcs.holycross.edu

from the address you wish to remove, and complete the three-way handshake.


